        <activityName xml:lang="en">Paper, woodfree, uncoated, at non-integrated mill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Paper, woodfree, uncoated, at non-integrated mill
na;
UUID: 3c237c91-a614-3b47-a546-2ec14e1d968f
This module includes the European production of uncoated woodfree paper in a non-integrated mill - including transports to paper mill, pulp preparation, paper production, energy production on-site and internal waste water treatment. ; Geography: Data from several European fine paper producers used as European average data.
Location:  Data from several European fine paper producers used as European average data.
Technology: Average of present used technology
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: Total European production in 2000: 10'203 kt (CEPI statistics)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3c237c91-a614-3b47-a546-2ec14e1d968f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
